# Semgrep path list (ADR-0018). Without this file Semgrep applies a built-in default list that
# silently left 32 tracked files unscanned — the test suites and the guards' own fault tests
# among them. This file replaces that default, so only generated or vendored trees are left
# out; everything a person or agent writes is scanned. Adding a path here is a reviewed change:
# scripts/meta_guard.py treats this file as scanner config.
node_modules/
.venv/
.next/
dist/
coverage/
.tools/
